  planner_response {
    response: "I have created and integrated the responsive footer section matching your design:\n\n### What was built:\n- **Exact Layout & Visual Match**:\n  - **Top Horizontal Divider**: Clean hairline border spanning the top of the footer.\n  - **Column 1 \342\200\224 About**:\n    - \"At MuscleForge, we believe in the power of dedication and hard work...\" descriptive mission text.\n    - Divider line directly under the paragraph.\n    - Interactive **Social Media:** links with `Fb`, `In`, and `Tw` click feedback and tooltips.\n  - **Column 2 \342\200\224 Quick Links**:\n    - `Home` (smooth scroll to top)\n    - `Our gym location` (opens interactive gym location & directions modal)\n    - `Contact Us` (opens interactive contact form with instant validation & message delivery)\n    - `Privacy policy` (opens comprehensive privacy compliance modal)\n  - **Column 3 \342\200\224 Our Service**:\n    - `Indoor gym`, `Outdoor gym`, `On ground gym`, `Yoga class` (each click opens rich service details with equipment lists, workout schedules, and coach assignments).\n  - **Column 4 \342\200\224 Contact Info**:\n    - `Mail:` `info@example.com` (with one-click clipboard copy + confirmation feedback)\n    - `Call:` `+91 9876543210` (active tel: link)\n    - `Location:` `New York, 235 Lane, 10001`\n    - `Time:` `Workout Hours: 5AM - 8PM`\n  - **Bottom Section**:\n    - Centered divider rule matching the screenshot.\n    - `websitename.com\302\2512024 all right reserve` with smooth \"Top\" scroll affordance.\n\n- **Responsive Across All Screens (Desktop, Tablet & Mobile)**:\n  - **Desktop (1024px+)**: Balanced 4-column layout matching the reference screenshot.\n  - **Tablet (640px \342\200\223 1023px)**: 2x2 grid layout with comfortable spacing and readable line measures.\n  - **Mobile (< 640px)**: Clean stacked layout with $\\ge 44\\text{px}$ touch targets.\n  - Fully synced with the in-app **Viewport Switcher** (Responsive, Desktop, Tablet, Mobile)."
